B.aun=new A.q3("Welcome to Grid","Search Wikimedia Commons and turn an idea into a useful set of files.","Start with the search field, then use media tabs and filters. Open a card to inspect, bookmark, or download it.","search","How to search",B.jE)
B.auq=new A.q3("Welcome to Map","Explore geotagged Commons media by location. Map and Grid share the same search session.","Search first or tap the map, adjust the radius, then select a marker or cluster to inspect its files.","map","Map guide",B.qO)
B.aur=new A.q3("Welcome to Author Portfolio","Review the public files uploaded under a Wikimedia username.","Enter an exact username, browse the upload grid, and open files to verify their creator, license, and source page.","author-portfolios","Portfolio guide",B.yx)
B.aup=new A.q3("Welcome to Browse Directories","Discover Commons categories, templates, and depicted subjects when you do not yet know the right search vocabulary.","Choose a directory, open a branch or search it, select useful entries, and apply them to Grid.","browse","Browse guide",B.hH)
B.aus=new A.q3("Welcome to Pipelines","Build repeatable visual workflows that find, refine, enrich, preview, and export Commons media.","Add nodes from the left palette, connect them on the canvas, configure the selected node on the right, then preview or export.","pipeline-getting-started","Pipeline guide",B.yr)
B.auo=new A.q3("Welcome to Bookmarks","Keep local references to files you want to revisit and organize them into folders.","Bookmark files from Search, Map, or the viewer. Here you can search your collection, group files, and export a manifest.","bookmarks","Bookmarks guide",B.lY)
B.aut=new A.q3("Welcome to Asset Viewer","Inspect a file at full size while keeping its Commons context close at hand.","Read the metadata and reuse panel, open the original Commons page, then bookmark or download the file when it is ready for your work.","inspect","Viewer guide",B.jD)
